{"availability":"available","full":"pdanpdan/virtual-scroll","name":"virtual-scroll","description":"Virtual scrolling for Vue 3: only the rows near the viewport are in the DOM. Lists, grids, tables and masonry at any size, with fixed, per-item or measured sizes. No dependencies besides Vue.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":13,"forks":1,"created":"2026-01-17T17:26:20Z","updated":"2026-10-01T21:35:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pdanpdan.github.io/virtual-scroll/","topics":["a11y","dynamic-size","fast","frontend","grid-view","infinite-scroll","javascript","performance","ssg","ssr","typescript","virtual-list","virtual-scroll","virtual-scroll-list","virtual-scrollbar","virtual-scroller","virtual-scrolling","vue","vue3","windowing"],"demo":"https://pdanpdan.github.io/virtual-scroll/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Vue","url":"https://github.com/vuejs/awesome-vue"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T12:58:36.896Z","stars":13,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:02:35.603Z","stars":13,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","stars":13,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A virtual scrolling component for Vue 3: only the rows near the viewport are in the DOM, so lists, grids, tables and masonry layouts stay fast however long they get.","Documentation and live examples: pdanpdan.github.io/virtual-scroll - every feature there is a running example with its code next to it, and the configurator writes the component for the options you pick.","Rows can be a plain vertical list, a horizontal strip, or a grid on both axes, in its own scroll container or in the page itself. Sizes can be one number, a value per row, or measured from the DOM as rows change. Sticky headers, snapping, infinite loading, RTL, keyboard navigation, ARIA roles, SSR and virtual scrollbars are opt-in, and there are dedicated components for table and masonry layouts. No dependencies besides Vue."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pdanpdan/virtual-scroll/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"23bfec4b06d449942efc6860a49da6fdd7d0e6fcb3a80c107311327c72be4b11","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T12:58:36.896Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A virtual scrolling component for Vue 3: only the rows near the viewport are in the DOM, so lists, grids, tables and masonry layouts stay fast however long they get.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pdanpdan/virtual-scroll/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"23bfec4b06d449942efc6860a49da6fdd7d0e6fcb3a80c107311327c72be4b11","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pdanpdan/virtual-scroll/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T21:35:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pdanpdan/virtual-scroll/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:44:28.762Z","hash":"23bfec4b06d449942efc6860a49da6fdd7d0e6fcb3a80c107311327c72be4b11","originalBytes":3069,"storedBytes":3069,"truncated":false},"subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":false},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://pdanpdan.github.io/virtual-scroll/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-15T13:14:41.145Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:14:41.145Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-15T13:14:41.145Z","target":"https://pdanpdan.github.io/virtual-scroll/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-22T13:14:41.145Z"},"previewAttem